only-on-platform:
  x86_64
# Rejects with: "aligned 32-byte stack access cannot be proven safe (the
# stack is only guaranteed 16-byte aligned; align the frame with
# `and $-32, %rsp` in the prologue, or else or use the unaligned form
# (e.g. vmovdqu/vmovups))" — the buffer's 32-byte vmovdqa cannot be backed by
# a frame whose effective alignment is 16.
